.PP
\fB--unsafe\fP[=false]
	operator master override (see scan --help)

.PP
\fB--yes\fP[=false]
	assume yes for install confirmations

.PP
\fB--zap-ajax\fP[=false]
	enable the ZAP Ajax spider (Docker runs only)


